  "problem": "Consider the function $y=\\frac{(x+1)^{{x}^{2}}}{{e}^{2-4x}}.$ The derivative of this function is given by\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\frac{(x+1)^{{x}^{2}-1}}{{e}^{2-4x}}((x+2)^{2}+g(x)).\n$$\n\nFind the function $g(x).$",
